{"id":"msg_m_ex_mana_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_mana","label":"Mana · Nikke"},"label":"1. Hello.","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_ex_mana_02","speakers":{"mana":"Mana"},"icons":{"mana":"si_c290_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_1","text":"Hello.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_2","text":"I'm Mana, a member of M.M.R. squad","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_3","text":"Are you Commander {AccountData.NickName}?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_4","text":"Yes, that's right.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_5","text":"You've apparently been given the authority to command me during the surface operation,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_6","text":"and so I wanted to speak to you about that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_7","text":"I chose to reach out to you via text because","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_8","text":"I don't want to take up too much of your time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_9","text":"Do you have a moment?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_10","text":"Sure.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_11","text":"Great.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_12","text":"Before I talk about the operation,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_13","text":"I should mention that while I'm a Nikke from the M.M.R. squad,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_14","text":"I am also a researcher affiliated with the M.M.R. research lab.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_15","text":"Is there any difference?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_16","text":"It's a matter of whether you will view me as a researcher","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_17","text":"or a Nikke.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_18","text":"???","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_19","text":"To put it simply:","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_20","text":"I am a Nikke assigned to you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_21","text":"but due to my role as an M.M.R. researcher,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_22","text":"I might often be unable to respond promptly due to my heavy workload.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_23","text":"I wanted to inform you of this in advance","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_24","text":"and ask for your understanding.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_25","text":"I hope that won't be a problem?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_26","text":"That's fine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_27","text":"Thank you for understanding","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_28","text":"You must be awfully tired.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_29","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_30","text":"Since you're affiliated with two different divisions, your workload must be twice as intense.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_31","text":"Oh, I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_32","text":"Well...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_33","text":"That's correct.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_34","text":"There is a lot of work I have to handle.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_35","text":"Quite a lot.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_36","text":"I wish people would consider that before assigning more tasks,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_37","text":"but they don't seem to.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_38","text":"Instead, they only end up giving me more work,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_39","text":"so I'm always busy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_40","text":"Would you like me to bring you a coffee?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_41","text":"I'm fine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_42","text":"Many of my coworkers are in the same boat as me,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_43","text":"so there are plenty of coffee machines throughout the lab.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_44","text":"I appreciate the offer, though.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_45","text":"Hang in there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_46","text":"I will.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_47","text":"Thank you for the encouragement","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_48","text":"Oh dear.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_49","text":"I've gone on for quite a bit.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_50","text":"Do you have anything else that you need to say to me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_51","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_51","text":"Not at the moment, no.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_52","text":"Understood.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_53","text":"Then I will see you next time when the opportunity arises.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_54","text":"Yeah, see you later.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_mana_01_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"mana","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_mana_01_55","text":"See you.","jump":null}],"chat":true}